    "mode": "explicit-classified",
    "gaps": [
      "a key set to a mapping, a sequence or a block scalar carries no value, so run: | states that a step is a script and not what the script is, runs-on: [self-hosted, linux] states no runner, and environment: written as a mapping is not stated",
      "env and permissions are stated at workflow level and at job level; a step-level env block is not stated, because a step's env key is told from a job's only by an ancestor named steps and a span join cannot assert the absence of one",
      "an expression is copied as written: a job output value is usually a steps.<id>.outputs.<name> expression and no rule resolves it to the step that produced it",
      "an anchor merge key is not expanded by omega-yaml, so keys a job inherits from an anchor are not declared at the job that merges them",
      "secrets are named and never valued"
